            "v": "cells",
            "zh": "细胞"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It makes the cell make more viruses. When there are too many viruses, the cell breaks "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Those viruses go out "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the body and keep making more viruses."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h3",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "How does a virus "
